<section class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE PROJECT</p><h1>Qsys Sensor App</h1><p class="lede">A warehouse indoor navigation platform, built in small, verifiable milestones.</p></section>
<section class="about-panel"><div><span class="eyebrow">PURPOSE</span><p>Help warehouse teams understand indoor movement through calibrated maps, device sensors and reliable positioning.</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT FOUNDATION</span><p>.NET 10 · Blazor WebAssembly · ASP.NET Core API · Clean Architecture</p></div><div><span class="eyebrow">CURRENT MILESTONE</span><p>Milestone 4 — Map Editor in progress. Draw aisle, truck aisle, stair, elevator, ramp, barcode and forbidden-area features. The navigation graph is regenerated from connected walkable lines and excludes forbidden regions.</p></div></section>
